#: ../../language/error_codes/E0078.md:1
msgid "E0078"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0078.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `result_error_return`"
msgstr "警告名称：`result_error_return`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0078.md:5
msgid "A function returns `Result[T, E]` even though `E` is an error type."
msgstr "函数返回了 `Result[T, E]`，但 `E` 本身是错误类型。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0078.md:7
msgid ""
"For a failable API, prefer MoonBit's error effect, written `T raise E`. "
"Keep a `Result` return type only when success and failure are "
"intentionally represented as ordinary data. This migration warning is "
"disabled by default."
msgstr ""
"对于可能失败的 API，优先使用 MoonBit 的错误效应，即 `T raise E`。只有在成功与失败确实要作为普通数据表示时，才保留 `Result` 返回类型。此迁移警告默认关闭。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0078.md:11
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0078.md:13
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub(all) suberror ParseError {\n"
"  ParseError\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn parse_number() -> Result[Int, ParseError] {\n"
"  Err(ParseError)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0078.md:17
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0078.md:19
msgid "Return the success type and declare the error with `raise`."
msgstr "返回成功值的类型，并用 `raise` 声明错误。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0078.md:21
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub(all) suberror ParseError {\n"
"  ParseError\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn parse_number() -> Int raise ParseError {\n"
"  raise ParseError\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
